      {"title": "AI rewrite suggestions", "desc": "Generative-AI-powered rewrites and subject-line alternatives generated from the score breakdown."},
      {"title": "Personalization Assistant", "desc": "Surfaces prospect and company data plus personality-based insights directly in the compose window."},
