                    {"title": "Magic Fill and Extend", "desc": "Magic Fill lets users select a region of an image and regenerate just that area; Extend expands an image beyond its original borders while preserving style and lighting."},
                    {"title": "Remix", "desc": "Reuses an existing image as a strong compositional and stylistic reference for a new generation, useful for maintaining visual consistency across a set of assets."},
                    {"title": "Upscale", "desc": "Enlarges generated images up to 2x resolution using a specialized model variant, useful for print or high-resolution use cases."},
