                    {"title": "Figma Plugin", "desc": "A published Figma Community plugin brings ImgGen's background-removal tool directly into Figma design files."},
                    {"title": "No Sign-Up Trial", "desc": "The core generator can be tried directly on the homepage before creating an account, lowering the barrier to first use."}
