                    {"q": "How much does a commercial plan cost?", "a": "Commercial usage starts at the $12 one-time Project plan (50 credits, watermark-free, 1 consistent character), with recurring plans from $35/mo (Basic) up to $300/mo (Business)."},
                    {"q": "What is a 'consistent character' and why does it matter?", "a": "It's a feature that locks in one AI model's face/body so the same model appears across an entire product catalog or campaign; the number of consistent characters you can maintain simultaneously scales with your plan, from 1 on Project up to unlimited on Business."},
                    {"q": "Do unused credits expire?", "a": "On the Starter plan, credits reset monthly and don't roll over. On Project, credits never expire. On Basic, Pro, and Business, unused credits roll over and accumulate as long as the subscription stays active."},
