                    {"q": "How much does Runway cost per month?", "a": "Paid plans start at $12/mo for Standard (billed yearly; $15/mo billed monthly, 625 credits/month), scaling to $28/mo for Pro (2,250 credits) and $76/mo for Max (9,500 credits). Enterprise is custom-priced."},
                    {"q": "How do Runway credits work?", "a": "Credits are spent per generation based on the model, resolution and duration. Standard and Pro credits reset each billing cycle and don't roll over; Max plan credits roll over for one additional month."},
                    {"q": "Is Runway worth it compared to Kling AI or other single-model tools?", "a": "Runway's advantage is bundling multiple models (including Kling itself) plus editing tools like Aleph in one subscription, which can be more cost-effective than subscribing to several single-model tools separately."},
