                    {"q": "Will using RepliQ hurt my email deliverability?", "a": "RepliQ states that because each video/message is unique rather than a mass-identical blast, it's designed to improve rather than hurt deliverability and engagement signals — though actual deliverability still depends on domain warm-up, sending infrastructure, and list quality, which are outside RepliQ's control."},
