                    {"title": "Master Reference Assets", "desc": "Users can lock in characters, products, logos or brand elements as reference assets so the agent preserves visual consistency across variations, video generation and localization."},
                    {"title": "Multi-model orchestration", "desc": "The platform routes requests across third-party and in-house models (Nano Banana, GPT Image 2, Seedream, Veo 3.1, Kling 3.0, Seedance 2.0, ElevenLabs audio) automatically based on the task."},
