                    {"title": "Built-in editor for scripts and timestamps", "desc": "Lets users edit the translated transcript, adjust timestamps, relabel speakers, and fine-tune voice settings before final export."},
                    {"title": "Translation dictionary and prompting", "desc": "Custom glossary and tone/formality prompting ensure specific terms and brand language are translated consistently across every video."},
                    {"title": "Auto subtitles and SRT support", "desc": "Generates and embeds captions automatically, or exports/imports standard SRT subtitle files for further editing elsewhere."},
