                    {"q": "Why do people complain about Replit's pricing?", "a": "Replit uses effort-based (credit) billing rather than a flat fee, so costs scale with how much work the Agent does — including failed attempts and bugs it introduces and then has to fix itself. This is the most common complaint across review platforms."},
