                    {"q": "How much does Factory cost?", "a": "Individual plans are Pro at $20/mo, Plus at $100/mo, and Max at $200/mo, each scaling rolling usage limits roughly 1x/5x/10x. Business (up to 150 seats) and Enterprise plans are custom and require contacting sales."},
