                    {"q": "Can Factory be used on-premise or with strict data controls?", "a": "Yes — the Enterprise tier offers on-premise deployment options, Zero Data Retention, customer-managed encryption keys, data residency, and dedicated partitioned compute, in addition to SSO/SAML/SCIM available at the Business tier."}
