                    {"q": "Can Notion AI answer questions using data from other tools like Slack?", "a": "Yes, via Enterprise Search (currently in beta on Business and Enterprise plans), which searches across connected apps including Slack, GitHub, Jira, Box, OneDrive, Salesforce and Asana in addition to Notion content."},
                    {"q": "What's the difference between Notion AI and Notion Agent?", "a": "Notion AI broadly refers to the writing, summarization and Q&A features available across the product, while Notion Agent specifically completes multi-step, agentic tasks using context from Notion, connected apps and the web."},
