                    {"q": "What types of content can TubeOnAI summarize?", "a": "It summarizes YouTube videos, podcasts, web articles, Google Drive files, and PDFs, including content up to 4 hours long."},
                    {"q": "Does TubeOnAI support languages other than English?", "a": "Yes, it supports summarization and translation in 22 languages, with content repurposing available in 30+ languages on paid plans."},
                    {"q": "Can TubeOnAI turn a video into a blog post or social content?", "a": "Yes, its content repurposing feature includes 150+ prompt templates for blog posts, Twitter threads, email newsletters, and podcast scripts, available on the Pro and Enterprise plans."},
