      {"q": "Is my email data secure?", "a": "The company states it uses industry-standard encryption, has passed Google's security review, and holds ISO/IEC 27001:2022 certification, with real-time processing and no stated persistent data storage."},
      {"q": "Can it write emails in other languages?", "a": "Yes — Mail Magic AI supports multilingual drafting and can translate messages, which reviewers specifically highlight as useful for international communication."}
