                    {"q": "What is Breeze AI?", "a": "Breeze is HubSpot's umbrella brand for its AI features, made up of Breeze Copilot (an in-app assistant), Breeze Agents (autonomous multi-step workflow agents) and Breeze Intelligence (data enrichment and buyer-intent signals)."},
                    {"q": "How much does HubSpot cost with AI tools included?", "a": "Entry pricing starts free (CRM) or $20/mo per seat (Starter, ~$15/mo annually). Professional and Enterprise tiers, which unlock most Breeze Agent capabilities, run from roughly $800/mo to $3,600+/mo depending on which Hub and contact tier you choose."},
                    {"q": "Is HubSpot worth it for a small business?", "a": "It depends on growth trajectory: reviewers generally recommend it for businesses planning to scale, since the platform grows with you, but caution that very early-stage or budget-constrained businesses often face a steep jump to Professional pricing."},
