                    {"q": "Can Frase publish directly to my website?", "a": "Yes, Frase integrates with WordPress, Webflow, Sanity, and Wix for direct publishing, or content can be hosted on Frase's own CMS (FraseCMS), which has a free tier for up to 100,000 monthly page views."},
