                    {"q": "Is there a genuinely free plan, or just a trial?", "a": "Dapta has a standing Free plan ($0/mo) with 2,000 credits, 1 agent, 2 flows, and 1 workspace — not a time-limited trial — alongside a separate promotional offer of 2,000 free credits on signup."},
                    {"q": "What CRMs and tools does Dapta integrate with?", "a": "It has dedicated native integrations for HubSpot, GoHighLevel, and Salesforce, plus a claimed 300+ native tool integrations and support for custom API and webhook connections, along with an MCP endpoint for developer-built extensions."},
