                    {"q": "What is a Megatoken?", "a": "A Megatoken is 1 million input tokens (roughly 750,000 words) consumed on HARPA's Cloud AI connection; output tokens cost about 3x input tokens, and premium models consume more tokens per request than efficient models."},
