                    {"name": "Pro Monthly", "price": "$8.49/mo", "billing": "monthly (40% off for students)", "features": ["Everything in Free", "Use your own AI API keys", "Unlimited use of Cloud and local AI models", "Translate any language to English", "Transcribe audio and video files", "Priority support"]},
