      {"title": "Guided Study", "desc": "Gives progressively stronger hints instead of the answer outright, then generates similar questions to confirm the student actually understood the concept."},
      {"title": "Voice Tutor", "desc": "Understands the page a student is on so they can ask questions out loud and hear a spoken explanation back."},
