      {"q": "Is Juma secure enough for enterprise use?", "a": "Juma is SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001, HIPAA and GDPR compliant, and offers private AWS cloud deployment for enterprise customers such as Salesforce and Charles Schwab."},
