      {"title": "Live Preview", "desc": "Test the app in the browser, on a physical device, or in iOS/Android simulators, with side-by-side views to compare changes before committing."},
      {"title": "One-Click Publishing", "desc": "Ship to web, iOS, and Android from a single workflow, with custom domains and App Store submission assistance available on paid tiers."},
      {"title": "Code Editing & Export", "desc": "Edit code directly, import files, and export the full source to GitHub or a zip archive at any time — there is no lock-in to the Draftbit platform."},
      {"title": "Built-in Supabase Backend", "desc": "A managed Supabase backend (currently in beta) handles data and auth without requiring a separate backend setup."},
