      {"title": "AI-assisted layout generation", "desc": "Describe the app or page you want in plain language and get an initial layout and data bindings generated automatically."},
      {"title": "Dynamic tables, forms, and charts", "desc": "Display and edit live data through pre-built components that stay in sync with the connected source."},
      {"title": "User authentication and permissions", "desc": "Control who can access which parts of an app with built-in login and role-based permission settings."},
      {"title": "Client portal support", "desc": "Build white-labeled, client-facing portals in addition to internal-only tools, with custom domain options."},
