      {"q": "Does Frontly require any coding?", "a": "No, Frontly is a no-code, drag-and-drop platform, though its AI features can also generate an initial layout from a text prompt."},
      {"q": "Can I build a client-facing portal, not just an internal tool?", "a": "Yes, Frontly supports white-labeled, custom-domain client portals in addition to internal-only tools."},
      {"q": "Does Frontly support user permissions?", "a": "Yes, built-in authentication and role-based permissions let you control who can access which parts of an app."},
      {"q": "Is there a free plan?", "a": "Yes, Frontly offers a free tier for building and testing basic apps, with paid plans for more apps, custom domains, and higher usage."},
